   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ZAF GEMLOG</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ZAF GEMLOG</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GEMLOG is a training programme for officials and politicians on local government level on how to integrate gender issues in municipality planning. The overall development objective is to improve the democratic consolidation in South Africa through gender policies and progammes at the local level. The programme stems from the LODLOG training programme. The support is for the pilot phase 2009-10.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">GEMLOG &#xE4;r ett utbildningsprogram f&#xF6;r kommunala tj&#xE4;nstem&#xE4;n och politiker hur genderfr&#xE5;gor inkluderas i kommunernas planering. Programmet genomf&#xF6;rs i samarbete SKL International.</narrative>
  </description>
